description: A flowchart in swimlanes: each lane is who does the step, the flow runs across them

lanes order: Order to cash {
  lane customer: Customer {
    place: Place order [pill, green]
    pay: Pay invoice
  }
  lane sales: Sales {
    check: Credit OK? [diamond]
    confirm: Confirm order
  }
  lane finance: Finance [blue] {
    invoice: Send invoice
    book: Book payment [pill]
  }
}

crm: CRM [cylinder]

place -> check
check -> confirm: yes
check -> place: no
confirm -> invoice
invoice -> pay
pay -> book
confirm ..> crm

comment on check: Who sets the credit limit?
